; backwards.twist - Swap Words, then Reverse Vibes
jz1 #9 @start           ; the first time through, #9 is 0, so skip ahead
ps1 "4. ...and runs off the top. The end."
ps1 "3. Twist turned around, so now it reads upward..."
@turn:
rv1
@start:
ps1 "1. Going down."
sw1 ps1 ad3             ; ps1 and ad3 swap jobs
ps3 #0 "2. ps1 is announcing cell #0, and ad3 prints text:"
ps1 #0
ad3 "   see?"
sw1 ps1 ad3             ; swap them back
ps3 #9 1                ; so the jz1 at the top won't jump next time
ps2 @turn
